note A Discord bot. Create it at the Discord developer portal, turn on Message Content Intent, then set the secret PLAINLY_SECRET_DISCORD_TOKEN.
allow running a Discord bot
when a Discord message arrives do
let said be the message text
if said contains the words hello end words then
reply with the words Hello followed by the message author
otherwise if said contains the words help end words then
reply with the words I can say hello. Try it!
end if
end when
start the Discord bot
